Title: Low Tide
Author: Dana Reyes
Draft date: October 22, 2026

INT. LAB - NIGHT

Rain on the *roof*.

MAYA
Listen. The pumps stopped an hour ago.

!CUT TO:

INT. HALL - DAY

Footsteps echo down the long empty hall.

INT. KITCHEN - MORNING

The kettle clicks off. Maya pours two cups and slides one across.

MAYA
I told you already.

EXT. ROOF - NIGHT

Wind tears at the antenna. Theo grips the cold rail with both hands.

THEO
What was that? Tell me you heard it too.

INT. CAR - NIGHT

The wipers beat against the rain.
